              "text" : "<strong><font data-custom-font=\"{!$cms.BrandonGrotesque_Black.name}\" face=\"Brandon Grotesque Black, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\">&#x1fa77;&#x1f3a8; Will my child have space to explore who they are becoming</font>?</strong><br /><br /><font data-custom-font=\"{!$cms.BrandonGrotesque_Medium.name}\" face=\"Brandon Grotesque Medium, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\">Children should have many chances to discover what they enjoy and what they are good at. Specialties such as <strong>art, music, chess, dance, soccer, basketball, and Taekwondo are part of the school day</strong> and give every child meaningful experiences that can become interests, strengths, and passions.</font><br /><br /><strong><font data-custom-font=\"{!$cms.BrandonGrotesque_Medium.name}\" face=\"Brandon Grotesque Medium, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\">&#x1f49c;&#x1f331; Will my child grow through meaningful opportunities beyond the classroom?</font></strong><br /><br /><font data-custom-font=\"{!$cms.BrandonGrotesque_Medium.name}\" face=\"Brandon Grotesque Medium, Arial, sans-serif, sans-serif\">Field trips, performances, competitions, school traditions, Z Clubs, and Z Teams give children new places to practice independence, friendship, teamwork, and courage. Learning becomes something they experience, not simply something they do at a desk.<br /><br />This is what it means for every child to be known, nurtured, and empowered: known by adults who understand them, nurtured through an education that develops their whole self, and empowered with the knowledge, confidence, and curiosity to keep discovering what they are capable of.<br /><br /><strong>This is what Zeta Elementary Schools promise.</strong> <br /><br />We invite you to come and ask all these questions, and more, in person at a Zeta school. <a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><u>Sign up for an upcoming event or tour</u></font></a> to learn more about our love-driven education.<br /><br /><br />Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team</strong><br />Zeta Charter Schools<br /><br /><br />Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta. Our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way:<br />✉️ enroll&#64;zetaschools.org<br />&#x1f4de; (646) 480-1654</font>"
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/paragraph",
            "id" : "8a150434-2d76-49db-b91c-1026d36eaaf2",
            "type" : "block"
          } ]
        } ]
